      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0433089d2fc089a868f98b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为她一直在不断挑战『天皇赏（春）』\n这个难关。精神上感到疲惫也是理所当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75aa4e166d4353cf276dfca088578d4a3fed3d7594fc5d533bab948f659617e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a627b25824297a5ed35316c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有没有什么我能做的事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a502d44557eb2de2e872f5e21646ab32ee27ba4378b20f27fc6239d9fe32e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
