      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，您是从『香豌豆锦标』开始\n就一直在看我比赛的吗。\n呵呵，一直以来，非常感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8eb70b7132f86f9fd0a38fbdb5080299435be01c7ca3ac3ed53080b3cd87e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
